        #         - Mode 2  : at least [axUserId] (other fields ignored)
        #      3) linesIn (container of line containers)
        #         - Each line: [transDateStr, typeValue, lineDescr, internacional, ticket, qty, price, lineProjId, attachFiles]
        #         - amount se calcula internamente como qty * price
        #      4) optionsIn (optional container): [mode, existingHojaGastosId]
